    {
      "index": 3,
      "name": {
        "en": "Lantern Vendor",
        "zh": "花灯摊主",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/花灯摊主_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Are they blocking your way?",
        "zh": "啊，挡着您路了吗？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "name": {
        "en": "Lantern Vendor",
        "zh": "花灯摊主",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/花灯摊主_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "(The vendor is leaning on a crutch, and one leg is in a cast.)",
        "zh": "（摊主拄着拐杖，一只脚上还打着石膏。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "name": {
        "en": "Lantern Vendor",
        "zh": "花灯摊主",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/花灯摊主_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "I twisted my ankle in an accident a couple of days ago. My family’s been busy preparing other stalls, so they haven’t had time to come help.",
        "zh": "前两天因为意外扭伤了脚，家里人都忙着别处店铺的准备，抽不开身来帮忙。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "name": {
        "en": "Lantern Vendor",
        "zh": "花灯摊主",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/花灯摊主_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "So I’ve had to set things up on my own, bit by bit.",
        "zh": "我只好自己慢慢悠悠架摊子，还好相邻的摊主们帮了我不少忙，现在也就差这点花灯没挂上了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": -1,
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": {
            "en": "Maybe I could help…",
            "zh": "也许我可以帮忙...",
            "ja": ""
          },
          "targetIndex": 10
        },
        {
          "text": {
            "en": "Could you move these out of the way?",
            "zh": "您能把这些挪开吗",
            "ja": ""
          },
          "targetIndex": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(I can’t just keep waiting around like this. Based on what I learned earlier, the troupe should have a stall somewhere at the festival grounds too.)",
        "zh": "（这样等下去也不是办法，根据之前的情报，戏团应该在大会会场也有摊位。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(I want to find their stall as soon as possible and see if I can gather some useful information.)",
        "zh": "（我想尽快找到它们的摊位，看看能不能收集到比较重要的信息。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_微笑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Well, how about I help you hang the lanterns?",
        "zh": "嗯，不如由我来帮您把花灯挂上吧。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Then let me help you hang the lanterns.",
        "zh": "那我来帮您把花灯挂上吧。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "name": {
        "en": "Lantern Vendor",
        "zh": "花灯摊主",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/花灯摊主_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "That’s exactly what I was waiting for!",
        "zh": "不错，就等着你这句呢！",
